// src/v4/extdeps/languages/english.dag
// Scope: Controlled English (CE) formal-subset language model — wave-1 structural carriers + wave-2a lex rules and grammar productions for article-led SVO and copula sentence forms + wave-3 emit-target rows (add slice) through the dissolved 06_translate fold.
// Status: T-4.19 (ratified 2026-05-27); wave-1 type carriers + wave-2a lex + grammar + probe; fail-closed on out-of-subset prose. Wave-3: English is an EMIT target — the add slice renders as rigid controlled-English prose, every sentence licensed by the wave-2a grammar.
// Anchor: Attempto Controlled English (ACE) grammar — http://attempto.ifi.uzh.ch/site/docs/ace_nutshell.html
// 🟡 feature:english-wave2-vocabulary — scaffold:T-4.19-wave2; dissolve-on: closed vocabulary declared; ^english_token_word catch-all replaced with per-word keyword rules or typed word set.

module v4.extdeps.languages.english

import v4.extdeps.languages.fidelity { FidelityDisposition }
